OL,3,AThe Crown star Josh O'Connor reacts to
OL,4,ABond rumours
OL,5,
OL,6,FBAFTA-nominated actor, Josh O'Connor,
OL,7,Fwho portrayed Prince Charles in
OL,8,FNetflix's The Crown says he is "very
OL,9,Fhonoured" by the speculation he could
OL,10,Fbe the next James Bond.
OL,12,FThe 36-year-old who grew up in
OL,13,FCheltenham, Gloucestershire and trained
OL,14,Fat the Bristol Old Vic Theatre School -
OL,15,Fhas been reported to be in the running
OL,16,Ffor the role alongside Callum Turner
OL,17,Fand Jack Lowden.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
