OL,3,AThe Crown star Josh O'Connor reacts to
OL,4,ABond rumours
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chosen actor will replace Daniel
OL,7,FCraig, who took over the role of Bond
OL,8,Fwith Casino Royale in 2006 and bowed
OL,9,Fout after his fifth film, No Time To
OL,10,FDie, in 2021.
OL,12,FOpening the Everyman Theatre's new
OL,13,Feducation and community centre in his
OL,14,Fhometown, O'Connor said: "To be
OL,15,Fconsidered in that same sort of bracket
OL,16,Fis extraordinary".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
